    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Throne Alone</strong></i>, a merciless, physics-based rage platformer set inside a mysterious desert testing ground. With no limbs, no wheels, and no explanation, you must hurl, strafe, and fall your way through a brutal vertical gauntlet built to break you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Supervisor is watching.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A glowing blue face etched into ancient walls taunts your every move. This is <strong>The Supervisor</strong>\u2014your ever-present judge, commentator, and tormentor. He mocks your failures, questions your purpose, and offers nothing but cryptic remarks and biting sarcasm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here? What is being tested? He\u2019s not telling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are the Toilet</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics and momentum-based movement. Launch yourself with precision\u2014or suffer humiliating setbacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Jump Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No retries, no easy saves. Control is everything, and the desert shows no mercy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anubis' Beacons</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach these ancient statues to mark rare, one-time respawn points. Fail to reach one? Enjoy the long fall back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reactive Supervisor Commentary</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He watches. He critiques. He insults. And maybe\u2026 he reveals a deeper mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Harsh Desert Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb crumbling ruins and surreal structures baked under a scorching sky. Every step forward is earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by the Best(or Worst?)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in the spirit of punishing games like <i>Jump King</i>, <i>Getting Over It</i>, <i>Alt+F4</i>, and <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Really Going On?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why a toilet? Why the desert? Why is a smug floating face talking to you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answers are somewhere\u2026 at the end. Probably.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Throne Alone</strong></i>, a merciless, physics-based rage platformer set inside a mysterious desert testing ground. With no limbs, no wheels, and no explanation, you must hurl, strafe, and fall your way through a brutal vertical gauntlet built to break you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Supervisor is watching.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A glowing blue face etched into ancient walls taunts your every move. This is <strong>The Supervisor</strong>\u2014your ever-present judge, commentator, and tormentor. He mocks your failures, questions your purpose, and offers nothing but cryptic remarks and biting sarcasm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here? What is being tested? He\u2019s not telling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are the Toilet</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics and momentum-based movement. Launch yourself with precision\u2014or suffer humiliating setbacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Jump Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No retries, no easy saves. Control is everything, and the desert shows no mercy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anubis' Beacons</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach these ancient statues to mark rare, one-time respawn points. Fail to reach one? Enjoy the long fall back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reactive Supervisor Commentary</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He watches. He critiques. He insults. And maybe\u2026 he reveals a deeper mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Harsh Desert Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb crumbling ruins and surreal structures baked under a scorching sky. Every step forward is earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by the Best(or Worst?)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in the spirit of punishing games like <i>Jump King</i>, <i>Getting Over It</i>, <i>Alt+F4</i>, and <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Really Going On?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why a toilet? Why the desert? Why is a smug floating face talking to you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answers are somewhere\u2026 at the end. Probably.</p>",
    "short_description": "Not your average toilet-sim: Throne Alone is a cursed physics platformer where gravity hates you, progress is pain, and a blue floating face roasts your every moment.",
